<br><span class=\"line\">    n = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    m = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    s = data[<span class=\"number\">2</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    t = data[<span class=\"number\">3</span>]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 统计两人答案相同的题数</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    a = <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> x, y <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">zip</span>(s, t) <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> x == y)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    b = n - a</span><br><span class=\"line\">    same = <span class=\"built_in\">min</span>(a, m)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    ans = <span class=\"number\">2</span> * same + b - m</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(ans)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    solve()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">a = <span class=\"built_in\">sum</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span> <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> x, y <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">zip</span>(s, t) <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> x == y)</span><br><span class=\"line\">b = n - a</span><br><span class=\"line\">same = <span class=\"built_in\">min</span>(a, m)</span><br><span class=\"line\">ans = <span class=\"number\">2</span> * same + b - m</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>a = sum(1 for x, y in zip(s, t) if x == y)</code>: 统计两人答案相同的题数。</li>\n<li><code>b = n - a</code>: 计算不同的题数。</li>\n<li><code>same = min(a, m)</code>: 朋友最多答对的题数。</li>\n<li><code>ans = 2 * same + b - m</code>: 计算小蓝最多能答对的题数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-3-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#5-3-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 优化技巧\"></a>5.3 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>本题没有明显的空间优化或时间优化空间，代码已经是最优的。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"复杂度分析\"></a>复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: O(N)，因为需要遍历两串答案。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: O(1)，因为只需要常数级别的额外空间。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入输出示例\"></a>输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>: <code>4 2\\nTTFF\\nFTTF</code></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>: <code>4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 错误地统计相同题数或计算小蓝的答对题数。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用简单的测试用例，逐步检查代码的逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结与扩展\"></a>总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 本题学习了如何通过逻辑推理解决问题，以及如何优化字符串比较。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将类似的逻辑推理应用到其他字符串处理问题中。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更复杂的逻辑推理算法，以及如何将逻辑推理与其他算法结合使用。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P12887","path":"api/tags/P12887.json"}]}